[{"title":"廿一兄以手和四清香见饷用心清闻妙香为韵成五小诗 其一","author":"曾几","text":"微雨久逾润，禅房低复深。\n下帷香一缕，收尽向来心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76766,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"廿一兄以手和四清香见饷用心清闻妙香为韵成五小诗 其三","author":"曾几","text":"不属蔚宗传，又非知见薰。\n从来香一瓣，只许自闻闻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76767,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"廿一兄以手和四清香见饷用心清闻妙香为韵成五小诗 其二","author":"曾几","text":"花覆春风殿，炉薰上紫清。\n旧时香案吏，趺坐对烟明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76768,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"木鱼戏成","author":"曾几","text":"缘木求鱼却得鱼，击鲜日日向斋盂。\n可怜钩挂濠梁上，大胜冯驩每食无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76769,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水芭蕉","author":"曾几","text":"寒泉中有小峥嵘，种得芭蕉积渐成。\n一叶似抽人不见，坐窗头白眼犹明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76770,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长淮有感","author":"曾几","text":"目送长淮去不回，登临万感集层台。\n波间定有隋渠水，曾向大梁城下来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76771,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"凤凰台","author":"曾几","text":"箫声无复到层台，画栋空馀燕雀来。\n我是凤凰池上客，等闲汀鹭莫相猜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76772,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"白龟","author":"曾几","text":"一种龟儿玉雪然，故人为寄小如钱。\n会当放汝江湖去，小住盆池慰眼前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76773,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石菖蒲","author":"曾几","text":"窗明几净室空虚，尽道幽人一事无。\n莫道幽人无一事，汲泉承露养菖蒲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76774,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再过翠屏","author":"曾几","text":"蛮荒乃有此巑岏，石黛因依碧玉寒。\n须信佳山如绝色，凭谁貌取一生看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76775,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"同官皆和复次韵 其五","author":"曾几","text":"大厦要直木，郢斤弃如遗。\n一朝谏省上，王魏不支持。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76776,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"同官皆和复次韵 其二","author":"曾几","text":"高标何许看，小阁有时上。\n烈风知人怀，柯叶尽西向。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76777,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寻梅至杨家见数株盛开","author":"曾几","text":"芒鞋竹杖寻梅去，只有香来未见花。\n村北村南行欲遍，数株如雪小民家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76778,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次奄中二陆韵","author":"曾几","text":"问石寻泉到竹斋，木犀花尽菊花开。\n老僧有约君知否，乘兴前村雪里来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76779,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江涨","author":"曾几","text":"雾里江流欲到天，旅人合眼梦归船。\n雨声竹屋晓来急，误喜全家蓬底眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76780,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"竹奴","author":"曾几","text":"雾帐桃笙昼寝馀，此君那可一朝无。\n秋来冷落同班扇，岁晚温柔是锡奴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76781,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"竹坞","author":"曾几","text":"烟雨百馀年，茅茨数间屋。\n中有在家僧，萧然如此竹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76782,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟中","author":"曾几","text":"滩声送我入严州，过得州来水漫流。\n一夜好风潮信早，满船明月荻花秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76783,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西崦","author":"曾几","text":"一重仍一掩，少有外人知。\n杖屦归来处，斜阳隐半规。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76784,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观四种梅 其一","author":"曾几","text":"花信风从底处来，水边探得一枝开。\n箯舆日日溪南北，看尽江梅看腊梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76785,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观四种梅 其二","author":"曾几","text":"斩新梅蕊破东风，一树鹅黄一树红。\n不着铅华元自好，未妨时世略相同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76786,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过花桥","author":"曾几","text":"溶溶水拍堤，了了花隔岸。\n不著小桥通，令人方寸乱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76787,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"求李生画山水屏","author":"曾几","text":"乞君山石洪涛句，来作围床六幅屏。\n持向岭南烟雨里，梦成江上数峰青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76788,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泛宅","author":"曾几","text":"芗林新赐宅，春水向鸥前。\n不是萧何第，元非范蠡船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76789,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"芭蕉","author":"曾几","text":"以此叶阴凉，代彼青琅玕。\n但恐本质脆，不堪期岁寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76790,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"怪石","author":"曾几","text":"眼前突兀见此石，怪怪奇奇俱可人。\n为问何如潘骑省，世间妍丑本非真。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76791,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"放鱼矶","author":"曾几","text":"一丝公不挂，钓饵也怜渠。\n旧日垂竿地，临流只放鱼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76792,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"松溪","author":"曾几","text":"不似居城市，澄湖上有松。\n日斜人影散，百尺卧苍龙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76793,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绍兴帅相公遗小春新茶且折简云对瑞香啜之大胜暖帐中饮羔儿酒也小诗两绝以谢 其一","author":"曾几","text":"打门将军得人惊，十月茶牙照眼明。\n漏泄春光凌雪色，柳条萱草太迟生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76794,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绍兴帅相公遗小春新茶且折简云对瑞香啜之大胜暖帐中饮羔儿酒也小诗两绝以谢 其二","author":"曾几","text":"酒压羔儿雪煮茶，红罗斗帐锦笼花。\n中书堂上权衡手，小物勤公定等差。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76795,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"觅梅","author":"曾几","text":"欲寻梅去不禁寒，宜著书签研滴间。\n闻道南坡开似雪，略分疏影到茶山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76796,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诗催","author":"曾几","text":"练裙染翰初不惜，布袋写真殊未来。\n并作山房一奇事，临岐更著小诗催。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76797,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郑侍郎送蜡梅次韵三首 其三","author":"曾几","text":"江梅难以蜡妆成，女手虽工未必能。\n香气恼人眠不著，若为学得定中僧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76798,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郑侍郎送蜡梅次韵三首 其二","author":"曾几","text":"小瓶梅映短檠灯，幽兴何人似我能。\n枉沐歌词无用处，维摩诘是在家僧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76799,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郑侍郎送蜡梅次韵三首 其一","author":"曾几","text":"折来梅与句争清，强和馀音本不能。\n欲向都官论一字，略无佳处似诗僧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76800,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郑侍郎家瑞香花盛开而未赏戏赠二首 其二","author":"曾几","text":"移春小槛绿樽前，记得花头数尺圆。\n传语郑庄修故事，锦薰笼畔过年年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76801,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郑侍郎家瑞香花盛开而未赏戏赠二首 其一","author":"曾几","text":"瑞香花发去年枝，惬对君家白玉池。\n复幕重帘开欲遍，馨香少有外人知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76802,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郑顾道冲雨见过","author":"曾几","text":"荷橐临门门未开，多泥穷巷遍苍苔。\n始知犹胜杜陵老，旧雨客来今亦来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76803,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"驾月桥","author":"曾几","text":"伐木梁清浅，扶藤日几回。\n嫦娥与牛女，昔日度桥来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76804,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鸣水驿","author":"曾几","text":"一道溪流百转深，挼蓝如色佩如音。\n青蔬几叶来何处，知有幽人底事寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76805,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南埭","author":"曾几","text":"薰风追晚凉，爱日引朝步。\n瘦策与青鞋，应知来往路。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76806,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"独步小园四首 其四","author":"曾几","text":"山衣重叠六铢轻，淡拂槐花染不成。\n报答春工选何物，鹅儿黄酒十分倾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76807,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"独步小园四首 其三","author":"曾几","text":"谁将山杏胭脂色，来作江梅玉颊红。\n但得暗香疏影在，不妨妆面对春风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76808,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"独步小园四首 其二","author":"曾几","text":"只道江梅发不迟，最先零落使人悲。\n从今秾李花千树，未抵前村雪一枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76809,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"独步小园四首 其一","author":"曾几","text":"江梅落尽红梅在，百叶缃梅剩欲开。\n园里无人园外静，暗香引得数蜂来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76810,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句","author":"曾几","text":"自公退食入僧定，心与香字俱寒灰。\n小儿了不解人意，正用此时持事来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76811,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送李商叟秀才还临川","author":"曾几","text":"一春雾雨暗溪山，城北城南断往还。\n政是晴时君又去，望君烟艇有无间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76812,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"食牛尾狸","author":"曾几","text":"生不能令鼠穴空，但为牛后亦何功。\n不如醉卧糟丘底，犹得声名异味中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76813,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"食杨梅三首 其三","author":"曾几","text":"饶阳接种江南少，越上楞梅天下无。\n梅熟应同儿辈吃，有兄八十住东吴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76814,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"食杨梅三首 其二","author":"曾几","text":"一月如绳雨泻檐，只言新竹渐多添。\n岂知政负幽人腹，不放杨梅蜜样甜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76815,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"食杨梅三首 其一","author":"曾几","text":"年年梅里见诸杨，火齐堆盘更有香。\n风味十分如荔子，何妨盛著绛纱囊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76816,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"食淮白鱼二首 其二","author":"曾几","text":"帝所三江带五湖，古来修贡有淮鱼。\n上方无复蠙珠事，玉食光辉却要渠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76817,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"食淮白鱼二首 其一","author":"曾几","text":"十年不踏盱眙路，想见长淮属玉飞。\n安得玻瓈泉上酒，藉糟空有白鱼肥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76818,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"食酥二首 其二","author":"曾几","text":"土酥绝类穆家儿，好著崔家饤坐梨。\n如梦甘寒千百颗，雪肌相伴出关西。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76819,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"食酥二首 其一","author":"曾几","text":"贡包分自浙西东，函谷金城在眼中。\n泛酒煎茶俱惬当，满前腊雪化春风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76820,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"剡溪竹纸三首 其三","author":"曾几","text":"会稽竹箭东南美，研席之间见此君。\n为间溪工底方法，杀青书字有前闻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76821,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"剡溪竹纸三首 其二","author":"曾几","text":"会稽竹箭东南美，化作经黄纸叠层。\n旧日土毛无用处，剡中老却一溪藤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76822,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"剡溪竹纸三首 其一","author":"曾几","text":"会稽竹箭东南美，来伴陶泓住管城。\n可惜不逢韩吏部，相从但说楮先生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76823,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夏夜闻雨","author":"曾几","text":"凉风急雨夜萧萧，便恐江南草木彫。\n自为丰年喜无寐，不关窗外有芭蕉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76824,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"家酿酒乡四首 其四","author":"曾几","text":"醉乡论石仍论斗，如此山重水复何。\n我觉去人殊不远，从来杯勺不能多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76825,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"家酿酒乡四首 其三","author":"曾几","text":"醉乡即是无何有，欢伯相招归去休。\n全以个中为境界，更于底处觅温柔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76826,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"家酿酒乡四首 其二","author":"曾几","text":"酒泉郡郭果何在，校尉兵厨安足求。\n即使愁城攻得破，策勋当拜醉乡侯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76827,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"家酿酒乡四首 其一","author":"曾几","text":"恶怀种种占胸次，俗物纷纷遮眼边。\n知有醉乡无路入，竹渠昨夜响山泉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76828,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"校书戏成","author":"曾几","text":"旧时天禄校书郎，习气薰人老未忘。\n可笑当窗楮生面，却成宫额半涂黄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76829,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"海棠","author":"曾几","text":"空谷嫣然笑靥开，春风元自蜀山来。\n少陵忘却浑闲事，更有离骚忘却梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76830,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"消梅花","author":"曾几","text":"未见枝间著子初，闻名已疗渴相如。\n花肌自是冰和雪，那得生儿不似渠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76831,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"痁病 其二","author":"曾几","text":"老身危似草头露，疾势来如江上潮。\n寒热自无安著处，不然何以脱今朝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76832,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"痁病 其一","author":"曾几","text":"谁言似病元非病，一日之间行四时。\n不用文殊来问疾，个中实怕有人知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76833,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"病起始浴二首 其二","author":"曾几","text":"欲著床头浣濯衣，汗流成雨垢成泥。\n呼儿为我供汤事，今日身轻好杖藜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76834,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"病起始浴二首 其一","author":"曾几","text":"无数尘埃一病身，不蒙湔拂几经旬。\n政须皂荚相料理，可笑梁州阴子春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76835,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诸公次韵予复次韵二首 其二","author":"曾几","text":"梅花过后杏花前，嫩蕊装成一盖圆。\n恼乱春风为渠了，幽香破睡有明年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76836,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诸公次韵予复次韵二首 其一","author":"曾几","text":"琐琐红英密缀枝，春风春物不差池。\n诸君但办樽前去，昨夜灯花报客知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76837,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读书四首 其四","author":"曾几","text":"勿谓微言久绝弦，六经正用此心传。\n假令坏壁无馀烬，日月堂堂故丽天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76838,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读书四首 其三","author":"曾几","text":"朝游夕泳一窗书，只要今吾胜昔吾。\n未识此间真气味，直缘圣处少工夫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76839,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读书四首 其二","author":"曾几","text":"童子区区攻一艺，老生汲汲事三馀。\n偶然领会忘言处，只有渊明解读书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76840,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读书四首 其一","author":"曾几","text":"黄卷中人最起予，病来相对却成疏。\n新凉试傍青灯看，犹有飞蚊小未除。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76841,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"途中二首 其二","author":"曾几","text":"小麦青青大麦黄，新蚕满箔稻移秧。\n绿阴马倦休亭午，芳草牛闲卧夕阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76842,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"途中二首 其一","author":"曾几","text":"鹁鸠晴雨报人知，更问农家底事宜。\n村落泥乾收麦地，稻田水满插秧时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76843,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"啜建溪新茗李文授有二绝句次韵 其一","author":"曾几","text":"北焙今年但取陈，草芽过了二分春。\n为君湔洗丁坑后，宝胯云团一样新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76844,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"啜建溪新茗李文授有二绝句次韵 其二","author":"曾几","text":"壑源今日为君倾，可当杯盘泻浊清。\n未到舌根先一笑，风炉石鼎雨来声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":76845,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]